    <Major>Roblox ASSASSIN Auto Afk Farm</Major>
    <Description>English

This macro is designed to prevent ROBLOX AFK detection from kicking you, it also will put out your weapon and repeatidly swing incase somebody comes close to you. This macro will earn you alot of ingame currency and is extremely benefitial.

Russian 

